  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A nonmagical weapon you touch becomes a magic weapon. Choose one of the following damage types: Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Thunder. For the duration, the weapon has a +1 bonus to attack rolls and deals an extra 1d4 damage of the chosen type when it hits.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> With a level 5–6 spell slot, the bonus to attack rolls becomes +2 and the extra damage 2d4. With a level 7+ spell slot, the bonus becomes +3 and the extra damage 3d4.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
